<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2372" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰκ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Att.
		 for 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεικίη</span> (q.v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>insulting treatment, outrage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				515
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>OC</u>
				748
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>torture</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.80.8
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				24.9.13
			</span></i>: pl., <i>torments</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				486
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.138
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Prose
			usu. law-term, <i>assault</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰκίας δίκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					425d
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				464e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦν ὁ τῆς βλάβης ὑμῖν νόμος πάλαι,
					ἦν ὁ τῆς αἰ., ἦν ὁ τῆς ὕβρεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				44
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			generally, <i>suffering</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.75
			</span></i>. [Prob. misspelt for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εια</span>
			(which is freq. v.l.); - - - in Poets.]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
